<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military has expanded airstrikes beyond its borders, bombing a health centre near the Thai border, striking homes in Tak province and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, while also hitting an IDP camp after an ASEAN envoy visit, causing damage to about 17 buildings. Thai authorities reported the strikes on October 31 and a seven-day suspension of unofficial border trade, and Thai royalist groups beat a migrant worker leader at a Bangkok UN protest. Myanmar refugees are filling labor gaps in Thailand as Cambodian workers return home. 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNd25lb1d3STE5REUxUURpLVpxcnM0UUswYVhZT3MwbENIb1l1WUtRMmt0ZHRmaVg1LXpmbVE1RExQMUNmbUtvanZqNEpTczNTWDFIYUk0bW56bkJzNlFBVkNjYTBUNmVUV1kzczJVTk5kVWY4MVF2aFliZFlxeldWYXNVb1VBMnNJbE5Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business Insider Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNYnJVaEF5RnZiN28yNW9zZkdwbURBajRiekE5eVVvWGJ2VnhpTURGUlFkVEJ5YU1IOC14ZE9PYUdBbXVqRzVFZHpfUFBmOGIteVRmM09wQVRIUXBsN2xfRnNjN3JvakpaVWU3ZTA5T2F2QURCVE85WldPUnZEckdlQlpmWW5FNklCWWY4bVcxREE5MzJqaEhBMw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNZEZNYnp3LW1JcHJtanhJY2FYbGNmNWx3Z0JzR2c3MzE1RzF0ZVBCOWV2RjJOazZDeC1jbzJOUUE3R281Z1Z5M18wVzh5WjVEQUpxM2ZiWjV2OUs0OUZ6aXE2aktnUU45MUJPYzh